-- ---- ss 721 and 722: the objection and the court's order ----

-- ss 721(2)(a), 722(1), 721(4), 722(3): a creditor applies on day 35, the last day, and gives notice the same day; the court orders on day 40 and the company delivers the order on day 55, 15 days after.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `ss 690-723 the objection to the payment and the court's order (ss 721, 722)` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (`a creditor`) NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `ss 690-723 an objecting member or creditor` DOES `s 721(1) the applicant applies to the court for the cancellation of the resolution` AT 35
    PARTY `ss 690-723 an objecting member or creditor` DOES `s 722(1) the applicant gives notice of the application to the registrar` AT 35
    PARTY `ss 690-723 the court` DOES `s 721(4) the court makes an order cancelling or confirming the resolution` AT 40
    PARTY `ss 690-723 the company` DOES `s 722(3) the company delivers to the registrar a copy of the court's order` AT 55

