#TRACE `ss 690-723 the objection to the payment and the court's order (ss 721, 722)` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (`a creditor`) NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `ss 690-723 an objecting member or creditor` DOES `s 721(1) the applicant applies to the court for the cancellation of the resolution` AT 36

